OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry
OL,6,Fthis evening with some late sunshine
OL,7,Fin places. Cloud thickening overnight
OL,8,Fwith some rain spreading south.
OL,9,FSouthern regions may see little if any
OL,10,Frain but a chance of heavier bursts in
OL,11,Fnorthern counties for a time. Staying
OL,12,Fmild.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FA rather cloudy day with the
OL,15,Fchance of the odd shower. Most places
OL,16,Fstaying dry with periods of hazy
OL,17,Fsunshine. Breezier and somewhat
OL,18,Ffresher, but still feeling rather warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
